{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:01.44] (KidWond3r, you made this beat? Dang!)\n[00:05.60] Yeah\n[00:06.02] Yeah, fall into my arms\n[Chorus]\n[00:10.52] Won't you fall into my arms?\n[00:13.32] Your tears fall, it's all my fault\n[00:15.96] But tears don't fall, they crash around me\n[00:19.00] Only real rockers'll get that part\n[00:21.56] She told me that I don't have appreciation for stars\n[00:24.42] If that's true, then how I fall in love with a star?\n[00:27.18] She told me that I don't have appreciation for art\n[00:30.02] If that's true, then how I fall in love with her scars?\n[00:32.48] I told her take her shoes off when she running inside my heart\n[00:35.50] All the dirt from the outside world will leave me scarred\n[00:38.12] It's been a couple times, I almost watched you leave\n[00:41.04] When you're not with me, baby, I can't breathe\n[Verse]\n[00:44.64] Uh, I remember I was in New York when you called me\n[00:48.58] \"I got some bad news, I got some bad news\"\n[00:51.34] I was in my hotel room when you called me\n[00:54.00] Turned to a sad dude, mentally bad dude\n[00:56.58] I don't wanna say too much and start arguing\n[00:59.84] I wanna love you, don't wanna hurt you\n[01:02.24] But I can't lie, that shit been on my mind\n[01:04.92] Since you told me, I ain't know how to tell you\n[01:07.68] Sad face, what's wrong?\n[01:09.56] \"I'ma tell you later, bae, I'm on my way home\"\n[01:12.12] It's when I get to stressing and assuming the worst\n[01:15.12] Blowing up your phone, trying not to go berserk\n[01:17.54] When you called me, and you said what you said, that shit hurt\n[01:20.50] Yeah, that hurt the worst\n[01:22.10] Said it was a accident, I hope it wasn't on purpose\n[01:24.60] Only been six months, but it feels like years\n[01:27.22] Remember South by, taking Xanax out your purse\n[01:30.54] We was high, love on our mind\n[01:33.34] Heavy vibes, souls intertwine\n[01:36.26] I ain't gon' lie, I damn near died\n[01:38.94] When you told me what happened that night\n[Refrain]\n[01:41.76] We was high, love on our mind\n[01:44.56] Heavy vibes, souls intertwine\n[01:47.60] I ain't gonna lie, I damn near died\n[01:50.18] When you told me what happened that night\n[Chorus]\n[01:52.62] Won't you fall into my arms?\n[01:54.38] Your tears fall, it's all my fault\n[01:57.02] But tears don't fall, they crash around me\n[02:00.04] Only real rockers'll get that part\n[02:02.60] She told me that I don't have appreciation for stars\n[02:05.48] If that's true, then how I fall in love with a star?\n[02:08.22] She told me that I don't have appreciation for art\n[02:11.08] If that's true, then how I fall in love with her scars?\n[02:13.58] I told her take her shoes off when she running inside my heart\n[02:16.56] All the dirt from the outside world will leave me scarred\n[02:19.22] It's been a couple times, I almost watched you leave\n[02:24.36] When you're not with me, baby, I can't breathe","words":[[0.78,1.34,"[Intro]"],[1.44,3.64,"(KidWond3r,"],[3.9,4.86,"you"],[4.9,4.96,"made"],[5.06,5.22,"this"],[5.26,5.36,"beat?"],[5.4,5.46,"Dang!)"],[5.6,5.96,"Yeah"],[6.02,6.08,"Yeah,"],[6.12,6.28,"fall"],[6.42,6.54,"into"],[6.66,6.94,"my"],[7.12,7.18,"arms"],[7.22,7.62,"[Chorus]"],[10.52,10.8,"Won't"],[10.9,10.98,"you"],[11.18,11.9,"fall"],[12.02,12.16,"into"],[12.26,12.52,"my"],[12.74,13.02,"arms?"],[13.32,13.54,"Your"],[13.64,13.94,"tears"],[14.02,14.5,"fall,"],[14.6,14.68,"it's"],[14.8,14.98,"all"],[15.08,15.3,"my"],[15.4,15.78,"fault"],[15.96,16.06,"But"],[16.12,16.38,"tears"],[16.48,16.7,"don't"],[16.78,17.3,"fall,"],[17.36,17.42,"they"],[17.5,17.98,"crash"],[18.12,18.52,"around"],[18.58,18.64,"me"],[19.0,19.18,"Only"],[19.3,19.52,"real"],[19.64,20.32,"rockers'll"],[20.36,20.56,"get"],[20.68,20.92,"that"],[21.02,21.4,"part"],[21.56,21.64,"She"],[21.72,21.9,"told"],[21.96,22.0,"me"],[22.12,22.26,"that"],[22.42,22.42,"I"],[22.46,22.64,"don't"],[22.68,22.82,"have"],[22.88,23.6,"appreciation"],[23.64,23.72,"for"],[23.8,24.34,"stars"],[24.4